From: Alberto Cavalcante <54247214+albertocavalcante@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Feb 2026 11:03:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] feat: add OnBranch callback for branch coverage
 instrumentation

Add Thread.OnBranch callback invoked after each conditional branch (CJMP).
This enables branch coverage collection in addition to line coverage.

The callback receives:
- fn: the executing function
- pc: program counter of the CJMP instruction
- taken: whether the branch was taken (true) or fell through (false)

Use fn.PositionAt(pc) to map the PC to source location.

Changes:
- Thread.OnBranch field in eval.go
- Callback invocation in interp.go after CJMP evaluation
- Tests for if/else branches and short-circuit and/or operators

TODO(upstream): trim verbose comments to match codebase style before proposing.
